{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_title", "source_sha256": "d7688ba4c82ba0990ed4bc7c49fd66896e5d408505f78f47bd49134af3329600", "ja": "亜美と舞台裏", "zh": "与亚美的舞台幕后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e1a4b99d73a626c2f6100cb5301022d3179161e30eb1a9ef1cd5b6074e40461e", "ja": "亜美との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "与亚美在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1000_402cpr", "source_sha256": "1f274fcf48f1b4af872e93c75cc8cef78a9f74998b471dc5c4e1a1fe967173e3", "ja": "今日はツアー用のアー写の撮影だ。\n亜美、しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "今天要拍巡演用的宣传照。亚美，可要好好表现啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "31c30cb10bd6b9563c8f01815995b4a2982623e1249953b9c2890547702f6031", "ja": "うん、しっかり頼まれたー！\n……でもさ。なんかスゴいよね、兄ちゃん。", "zh": "嗯，交给我吧——！\n……不过呀。感觉好厉害呢，兄长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1002_402cpr", "source_sha256": "e16373aa49a3c40c46c40033b9741442f332078d54aeffbaf4ac806b36586712", "ja": "？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "3e9e9eb14134edb99b460d1c71ac4a69672f9f936a7019f16e9e816d1fa84ada", "ja": "ここ、変形しそうな機材とかいっぱいあるし、\nスタッフさんもいっぱいいるっしょ？", "zh": "这里有好多看起来像是会变形的设备，工作人员也有很多，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "f710d1e28b94fefa4b2a84eef9d202dbc8b36595a8a55a13ece93dc9554e7a83", "ja": "ほら、亜美たちがアイドルになったばっかの時は、\nもっとこじんまりした感じだったのにね～。", "zh": "你看，想当偶像之初，亜美她们这边明明还小小的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1005_402cpr", "source_sha256": "6f9d413e91c22c4a940ed444b6053c29745dd673cee708e24235fd9bc31ace8d", "ja": "そうだな……。しかも、時間内に終わるように、\n急いで着替えてもらったりもしてたっけ。", "zh": "是啊……而且那时候为了能在规定时间内结束，还得催着你们赶紧换衣服呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "f1d5ed8118fb811e5b441b4928084e551577014e2b91e6ad90ae964378aa9fc4", "ja": "いやぁ、亜美たちも出世しましたなぁ。\nゲーノージンですなぁ。スーツにサインしとく？", "zh": "哎呀，咱们也出人头地了啊。都成名人了呢。要不要我在西装上给你签个名？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1007_402cpr", "source_sha256": "2b53481174bdbab2422bc2d3eee221f73a6e82e3eec75a2da8987cb20d412439", "ja": "調子に乗らない。\nそれとも、出世したからもう満足か？", "zh": "别得意忘形。还是说，出人头地了就已经满足了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "2614d3ed46f1f718f8c2b62c27465b65c5c074a36e07ac837bb389df310ba4fe", "ja": "ううん、めっちゃ面白くなってきたトコ！　事務所の\n仲間も増えてるし～。亜美よりちっちゃい子も来るの？", "zh": "不是啦，正变得越来越有意思呢！事务所的\n伙伴也越来越多了～还会有比亚美更矮的孩子来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1009_402cpr", "source_sha256": "c4ccb9645abc719ae6968d9e50d8600edcf620bfbc57c678185c5ad605bdef00", "ja": "たぶんな、アイツ次第だけど。そういう子を歓迎するた\nめにも、今回のツアーライブ、しっかり成功させるぞ！", "zh": "大概吧，不过还得看那家伙。为了欢迎那样的孩子，这次巡回演唱会也要好好办成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_011ami_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_011ami_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "ad5fdb7ceda08616524f1374b009f94a1681d4906456814fbcb41bb5813019c4", "ja": "了解だよ兄ちゃん！　ツアーも成功させて、仲間も\nめっちゃ増やして。ずーっと、どこまでも行こうね！", "zh": "明白啦，哥哥！巡演也要成功，再让伙伴大大增加。一直一直，走到天涯海角吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
